# Azure Deployment

This project deploys the Python application to Azure Container Apps using Azure Container Registry.

## Azure Resources

| Resource | Name |
|----------|------|
| Resource Group | `rg-hajar-aca-prf2026` |
| Azure Container Registry | `acrhajar2026` |
| Container Apps Environment | `env-hajar-aca` |
| Azure Container App | `aca-pyweb-hajar` |
| Region | `francecentral` |

## Infrastructure

The `infra/` folder contains the scripts used to provision and destroy the Azure infrastructure.

- `create.ps1` creates the Azure resources.
- `destroy.ps1` removes the Azure Resource Group and all associated resources.

